

# type(scope)!: imperative subject, lowercase, no period, <= 72 chars
#
# Body: what changed and why, not how. Wrap at 72 characters.
#
# Footers, one per line:
#   Closes #123
#   Refs #45
#   BREAKING CHANGE: what breaks and how to migrate
#   Co-authored-by: Name <email@example.com>
#
# Types:  feat fix docs refactor perf test build ci chore style revert
# Scopes: plugin skill checker docs site ci deps bench (optional)
# "!" after the type or scope marks a breaking change.
#
# Examples:
#   fix(checker): reject local links that escape the project root
#   feat(checker)!: exit with code 2 on configuration errors
#   docs: explain the release verification steps
#
# Use this template: git config commit.template .gitmessage
# Lines starting with "#" are removed. See CONTRIBUTING.md.
